# /settings' Reasoning effort row (D2b's effort, in plan since 87c9ed9), on a
# model whose catalog row lists levels (`zai/glm-5.2`: low, high): the row's
# choices, Right round them and the saves, then a model with no levels
# (`fake/model-a`), where the row is its value alone. Down is counted per
# binary: fx lists Fast and Ultra between them, xfx does not.
models models-effort.json
fx: seed settings-effort-seed-fx.json
xfx: seed settings-effort-seed-xfx.json
nomodel
wait 2.5
type /model
key Enter
wait 1.5
key Escape
wait 0.5
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
snap bare
key Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
snap marked
key Right
wait 1
snap right1
home right1
key Right
wait 1
snap right2
home right2
key Right
wait 1
snap right3
home right3
key Left
wait 1
snap left
home left
key Escape
wait 0.5
type /model fake/model-a
key Enter
wait 1.2
type /settings
key Enter
wait 1
key Down Down Down Down Down Down
wait 0.3
snap no-levels
key Right
wait 1
snap no-levels-right
home no-levels-right
